      "documentId": "doc_qsuk8eg7mt8ruar1",
      "index": 0,
      "page": 1,
      "section": "Title / Overview",
      "text": "Government Welfare Scheme Notification 2026\nThe Department of Social Welfare launched the Suraksha Benefit Scheme on 1 August 2026.",
      "createdAt": "2026-08-25T14:39:50.510Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "chunk_mloxyzcpmt8ruar2",
      "documentId": "doc_qsuk8eg7mt8ruar1",
      "index": 1,
      "page": 1,
      "section": "Eligibility",
      "text": "Eligible households with annual income below INR 2,50,000 may apply through district service centres.",
      "createdAt": "2026-08-25T14:39:50.510Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "chunk_ch0z76tumt8ruar2",
      "documentId": "doc_qsuk8eg7mt8ruar1",
      "index": 2,
      "page": 1,
      "section": "Deadlines",
      "text": "Applications close on 20 September 2026.",
      "createdAt": "2026-08-25T14:39:50.510Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "chunk_rlxdp5o7mt8ruar2",
      "documentId": "doc_qsuk8eg7mt8ruar1",
      "index": 3,
      "page": 1,
      "section": "Financial Details",
      "text": "The scheme provides a one-time benefit of INR 10,000 after verification.",
      "createdAt": "2026-08-25T14:39:50.510Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "chunk_09ywp1mrmt8ruar2",
      "documentId": "doc_qsuk8eg7mt8ruar1",
      "index": 4,
      "page": 1,
      "section": "Eligibility",
      "text": "District officers must publish beneficiary lists within 30 days. [1] Section: Eligibility and Benefits.",
      "createdAt": "2026-08-25T14:39:50.510Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "chunk_e3492ojqmt8ruar7",
      "documentId": "doc_9am8qzznmt8ruar7",
      "index": 0,
      "page": 1,
      "section": "Title / Overview",
      "text": "District Disaster Management Authority Cyclone Preparedness Alert\nIssued on 20 September 2026 for coastal blocks.",
      "createdAt": "2026-08-25T14:39:50.515Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "chunk_v4vptiqamt8ruar7",
      "documentId": "doc_9am8qzznmt8ruar7",
      "index": 1,
      "page": 1,
      "section": "Deadlines",
      "text": "Citizens in low-lying areas must move to shelters by 6 PM.",
      "createdAt": "2026-08-25T14:39:50.515Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "chunk_zpxgj9ngmt8ruar7",
      "documentId": "doc_9am8qzznmt8ruar7",
      "index": 2,
      "page": 1,
      "section": "Risk / Advisory",
      "text": "Emergency helpline 1077 will operate continuously.",
      "createdAt": "2026-08-25T14:39:50.515Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "chunk_ntz58i0rmt8ruar7",
      "documentId": "doc_9am8qzznmt8ruar7",
      "index": 3,
      "page": 1,
      "section": "Risk / Advisory",
      "text": "Fishing activity is suspended until 22 September 2026.",
      "createdAt": "2026-08-25T14:39:50.515Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "chunk_74roelwdmt8ruar7",
      "documentId": "doc_9am8qzznmt8ruar7",
      "index": 4,
      "page": 1,
      "section": "Deadlines",
      "text": "Schools in affected blocks remain closed on 21 September 2026. [1] Section: Public Safety Advisory.",
      "createdAt": "2026-08-25T14:39:50.516Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "chunk_b5ji4r7pmt8ruar8",
      "documentId": "doc_047tgjirmt8ruar8",
      "index": 0,
      "page": 1,
      "section": "Title / Overview",
      "text": "Education Department Digital Learning Policy 2026\nThe policy provides tablets to students of classes 9 to 12 in government schools.",
      "createdAt": "2026-08-25T14:39:50.516Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "chunk_omebncbjmt8ruar8",
      "documentId": "doc_047tgjirmt8ruar8",
      "index": 1,
      "page": 1,
      "section": "Deadlines",
      "text": "Schools must complete beneficiary verification by 15 October 2026.",
      "createdAt": "2026-08-25T14:39:50.516Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "chunk_8rcdbiylmt8ruar8",
      "documentId": "doc_047tgjirmt8ruar8",
      "index": 2,
      "page": 1,
      "section": "Source Section",
      "text": "District officers must submit implementation reports every month.",
      "createdAt": "2026-08-25T14:39:50.516Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "chunk_21mx5tllmt8ruar8",
      "documentId": "doc_047tgjirmt8ruar8",
      "index": 3,
      "page": 1,
      "section": "Financial Details",
      "text": "Budget allocation is INR 10 crore for phase one. [1] Section: Implementation Guidelines.",
      "createdAt": "2026-08-25T14:39:50.516Z"
    },
